<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Aristocrat 96/97 estimate achievable.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Aristocrat 96/97 estimate achievable.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gaming machine maker Aristocrat Leisure Ltd said on Thursday the prospectus forecasts for the year ending June 30, 1997 remain achievable, providing certain gaming issues are resolved in Queensland and New South Wales.</p>
</text>
